<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Intl Game said raised by Pru.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Intl Game said raised by Pru.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential raised its rating of International Game Technology to a buy from a hold on Thursday, according to a source at the firm.</p>
<p>-- The stock was given a 12 month price target of 24.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 18-1/2 on Wednesday on the NYSE.</p>
<p>-- No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
